<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ecolab upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ecolab upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term rating on Ecolab Inc to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Friday at 31-1/4.</p>
</text>
